{"type":"standard","title":"Keisha Lance Bottoms","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Keisha Lance Bottoms</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q42770663","titles":{"canonical":"Keisha_Lance_Bottoms","normalized":"Keisha Lance Bottoms","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Keisha Lance Bottoms</span></span>"},"pageid":55731159,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fe/Keisha_Lance_Bottoms.jpg/330px-Keisha_Lance_Bottoms.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":371},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/fe/Keisha_Lance_Bottoms.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","width":2400,"height":2701},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1378050658","tid":"90d67a5c-be88-11f1-b1f6-90e81260f910","timestamp":"2026-10-02T17:41:58Z","description":"American attorney and politician (born 1970)","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Keisha_Lance_Bottoms","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Keisha_Lance_Bottoms?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Keisha_Lance_Bottoms?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Keisha_Lance_Bottoms"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Keisha_Lance_Bottoms","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Keisha_Lance_Bottoms","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Keisha_Lance_Bottoms?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Keisha_Lance_Bottoms"}},"extract":"Keisha Lance Bottoms is an American attorney and politician who served as the 60th mayor of Atlanta, Georgia, from 2018 to 2022. Previously, she served as a member of the Atlanta City Council from 2010 to 2018, representing part of Southwest Atlanta. She is a member of the Democratic Party.","extract_html":"<p><b>Keisha Lance Bottoms</b> is an American attorney and politician who served as the 60th mayor of Atlanta, Georgia, from 2018 to 2022. Previously, she served as a member of the Atlanta City Council from 2010 to 2018, representing part of Southwest Atlanta. She is a member of the Democratic Party.</p>"}